<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Gestionar Materias del Plan</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Plan de Estudio: {{plan_name}} ({{plan_code}})</h1>
    <h3>Carrera: {{career_name}}</h3>

    <hr>

    {{#errorMessage}}
        <p style="background-color: #ffcccc; color: #cc0000; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #cc0000;">{{errorMessage}}</p>
    {{/errorMessage}}

    <h2>1. Asignar Materias Existentes</h2>
    <p><i>Nota: Al asignar una materia ya existente, esta se vinculará a este plan de estudio.</i></p>
    <form action="/admin/careers/{{career_id}}/plans/{{plan_id}}/subjects/assign" method="POST">
        <div style="max-height: 300px; overflow-y: auto; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
            <table border="1" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-align: left;">
                <thead>
                    <tr style="background-color: #eee;">
                        <th>Asignar</th>
                        <th>Código</th>
                        <th>Nombre</th>
                        <th>Horas Semanales</th>
                        <th>Modalidad</th>
                        <th>Correlativas</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#allSubjects}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>
                            <input type="checkbox" id="subject_{{id}}" name="subject_ids" value="{{id}}" {{#selected}}checked{{/selected}}>
                        </td>
                        <td><strong>{{code}}</strong></td>
                        <td>{{name}}</td>
                        <td>{{weekly_hours}} hs</td>
                        <td>{{modality}}</td>
                        <td><small>{{dependencies}}</small></td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/allSubjects}}
                    {{^allSubjects}}
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="6">No hay materias cargadas en el sistema actualmente.</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/allSubjects}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <button type="submit">Guardar Relaciones de Materias</button>
    </form>

    <br>
    <hr>

    <h2>2. Crear una Nueva Materia y Añadirla a este Plan</h2>
    <form action="/admin/careers/{{career_id}}/plans/{{plan_id}}/subjects/new" method="POST">
        <fieldset>
            <legend>Datos de la Asignatura</legend>
            
            <label for="subject_name">Nombre de la Materia:</label><br>
            <input type="text" id="subject_name" name="name" required><br><br>

            <label for="subject_code">Código de la Materia:</label><br>
            <input type="text" id="subject_code" name="code" required><br><br>

            <label for="weekly_hours">Horas Semanales:</label><br>
            <input type="number" id="weekly_hours" name="weekly_hours" min="1" required><br><br>

            <label for="modality">Modalidad:</label><br>
            <select id="modality" name="modality" required>
                <option value="Presencial">Presencial</option>
                <option value="Virtual">Virtual</option>
                <option value="Híbrida">Híbrida</option>
            </select><br><br>

            <label for="required_subject_id">Materia Correlativa Requerida (Opcional):</label><br>
            <select id="required_subject_id" name="required_subject_id">
                <option value="">-- Ninguna --</option>
                {{#currentPlanSubjects}}
                    <option value="{{id}}">{{code}} - {{name}}</option>
                {{/currentPlanSubjects}}
            </select><br><br>

            <input type="checkbox" id="requires_approved" name="requires_approved" value="true">
            <label for="requires_approved">¿Requiere examen final aprobado? (Si no se marca, solo requiere cursada regular)</label><br>
        </fieldset>
        <br>
        <button type="submit">Crear y Añadir Materia</button>
    </form>

    <br><br>
    <a href="/admin/careers/{{career_id}}"><button type="button">Volver al Detalle de la Carrera</button></a>
</body>
</html>